1
a scheme ipn 'ipnfw' 'ipnadminep'
a endpoint ipn:1.0 x
a endpoint ipn:1.1 x
a protocol ltp 1400 100
## An outduct with no convergence-layer output command.  The egress plan
## needs a duct to name, but with no CLO daemon nothing ever calls
## bpDequeue(), so a queued bundle stays queued -- and keeps its
## xmitOverdue timer -- until a contact boundary re-forwards it.
a outduct ltp 2 ''
r 'ipnadmin config.ipnrc'
s
